cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Undercover Agents: code, preregistration and results for a trusted-agent sting study"
abstract: >-
  Preregistered study, run during the Apart Research AI Collusion Research Sprint (question 3.2),
  of whether a scripted trusted agent that privately offers LLM agents a collusive pact in Liar's
  Bar exposes and deters pact-taking. Includes the study code, the hash-frozen preregistration,
  the deviations log, the aggregate results and the paper build.
